		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Stone-hided whale from the Plane of Fire. Gizzard is lined with gems. Hunted by efreeti. Kills genies on sight.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tail slap +7 (3d6), <strong>MV</strong> double near (burrow, fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Capsize</strong>. Opposed STR versus captain's INT or ship is capsized and begins to sink.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flaming Body</strong>. Creatures within close of whale at start of turn CON 15+ or 1d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Only damaged by magical sources. Immune to fire.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
